    <rdfs:comment>dose interval 'AtOrBelowOptimum' for Nicotiana tabacum, relative to the reported statistics; bounds from Alves &amp; Arthur 2025, TSF J. Biol. 3(2):26-51 (stimulation optimum only; that study reports no LD50 and its dose series ends at 20 Gy)</rdfs:comment>
